testResultMetadataWrappers;req;r;db;con;st;result;stmt_type;ret_type
⍝ Isolated test for result metadata wrappers.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Result Metadata Wrappers'

db←open ':memory:'
con←connect db
(st result)←api.duckdb_query con 'SELECT 42 AS answer' 6
r,←⊂'Query for result metadata wrappers' req DuckDBSuccess=st

:If DuckDBSuccess=st
    stmt_type←resultStatementType result
    r,←⊂'resultStatementType is SELECT' req 1=stmt_type

    ret_type←resultReturnType result
    r,←⊂'resultReturnType is non-zero' req ret_type≠0

    {}api.duckdb_destroy_result ⊂result
:EndIf

⍝ Null guards
r,←⊂'resultStatementType(null) guarded zero' req 0=resultStatementType 0
r,←⊂'resultReturnType(null) guarded zero' req 0=resultReturnType 0

{}disconnect con
{}close db

⎕←↑r
⎕←''
⎕←'Result metadata wrapper testing complete!'

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
